This crate is a Rust port of the AD9361 driver and the AXI ADC/DAC core drivers of the Analog
Devices no-OS repository (https://github.com/analogdevicesinc/no-OS): the structure, the
algorithms, the register definitions and the tables all follow those sources. The port stays
covered by the license of the files it is derived from, which is the following 3-clause BSD
